// 9936
[enum_9936]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,You'll need to contact Player Support for an answer to that.
val=1,You can contact our support team via the RuneScape website.
val=2,That seems like a bug - can you submit a bug report?
val=3,Sorry, JMods can't do that!
val=4,Sounds like a cool idea, put it on RuneLabs!
val=5,Please report any bots you see so our team can take a look.
val=6,Don't forget to follow @RuneScape on Twitter.
val=7,Great to hear your feedback. I'll be sure to pass it on to the right people!
val=8,You can't apply to be a P-Mod - if chosen we contact you via game inbox.
val=9,We select players who are friendly, helpful and who follow the rules for P-Mod.
val=10,Head to the Events & Competitions forum to find out about JMod run events.
val=11,You can submit a bug report by clicking on the flag on your chat box.
val=12,Please stop spamming.
default=

