val=5,Completed all Court Cases.
val=6,Claimed the Enhanced Fire Cape override.
val=7,Fully level up all Temple Trekking companions.
val=8,Defeated the Phoenix once post-In Pyre Need.
val=9,Completed all Player-Owned Ports story voyages.
val=10,Unlocked the Firemaker's Outfit from the circus.
val=11,Gained access to the Abyss.
val=12,Fully upgraded the Thieves' Guild.
val=13,Completed Doric & Boric's tasks.
val=14,Put Clarence to rest.
val=15,Complete the Hopespear's Will miniquest.
val=16,Completed the Koschei's Troubles miniquest and unlocked all jewel memories.
val=17,Found TzHaar-Ga'al-Kot.
val=18,Completed Rag and Bone Man & Fur'n'seek wishlists and killed the Skeletal Horror once.
val=19,Completed Sheep Shearer and Witch's Potion miniquests.
val=20,Completed the Mahjarrat memories miniquest.
val=21,Completed the God Emissaries miniquest.
val=22,Unlocked the Vyrelord/Vyrelady title and reached maximum reputation with the vyres.
val=23,Unlocked the Annihilator title.
val=24,Completed the Azdaran document.
val=25,Completed the Voice of the Elders in Prifddinas.
val=26,Cleansed the murals in Brimhaven dungeon and Mount Firewake and updated the Dragonkin Primer.
val=27,Purchased the Mad Ramblings.
val=28,Completed the Scabaras research.
val=29,Found and read Sakirth, Strisath and Kalibath's Journals, and Phalaks' Experiment Log from Adamant Dragons in the Dragonkin Lair.
val=30,Reconstructed Bandos's Memories from chronicle fragments.
val=31,Heard Vorago's introduction dialogue.
val=32,Unlocked all non-easter egg Prifddinas Memoriam Crystals.
val=33,Used The Measure to find the four Elder Chronicles.
val=34,Unlocked all ten elder chronicle entries.
val=35,Completed Forcae's journal.
val=36,Found and read the Last Riders book.
val=37,Found and read all of Kerapac's Dragonkin journals.
val=38,Found all Chronicles of Bilrach.
val=39,Found all Kal'Gerion Notes.
val=40,Found all Stalker Notes.
val=41,Found all Behemoth Notes.
val=42,Found all Marmaros and Thok letters.
val=43,Found Misc. Dungeoneering journals 1 through 15.
val=44,Found all five God Wars journals.
val=45,Found and read the Explorer's notes.
val=46,Completed History of the Order of Ascension.
val=47,Found all Mazcab stone fragments and taken them to the Ancient statue.
val=48,Completed the Dominion journal.
val=49,Found all Ancient Cavern pages.
val=50,Completed Kaigi's journal.
val=51,Claimed the Malleus daemoniorum.
val=52,Claimed the experience reward and watched the epilogue following While Guthix Sleeps.
val=53,Claimed the XP reward post-Blood Runs Deep.
val=54,Claimed the XP reward from Daero following Monkey Madness.
val=55,Unlocked Char's training cave and completed a Zaros symbol.
val=56,Unlocked Dig Site pendants.
val=57,Claimed the Helmet of Trials.
val=58,Claimed Ancient Bones from Father Aereck post-The Restless Ghost.
val=59,Completed all tasks from Dimension of Disaster.
val=60,Unlocked all rewards from Dimension of Disaster.
val=61,Unlocked Templar and Dulcin armour post-Death of Chivalry.
val=62,Claimed the XP from the Gilded cabbage, Combat and Prayer XP lamps and looted the supply crate post-Death of Chivalry.
val=63,Lit the campfire and found a haul of exotic herbs and herb seeds post-Fairy Tale III.
val=64,Unblocked the hollow log and tunnel shortcut post-Fairy Tale III.
val=65,Given the Tooth Fairy five teeth and claimed a tooth creature pet.
val=66,Unlocked the secret door between Crandor and Karamja.
val=67,Claimed the reward from The Rusty Anchor's bartender after taking the order to Braindeath.
val=68,Looted the chest from the pyramid during or post-Icthlarin's Little Helper.
val=69,Claimed the extra rewards from Cook post-Cook's Assistant.
val=70,Claimed the extra rewards from Professor Oddenstein post-Ernest the Chicken.
val=71,Claimed 1,940 coins from Fred the Farmer post-Sheep Shearer miniquest.
val=72,Claimed XP from the Holy Cithara.
val=73,Claimed the goblin cower shield.
val=74,Opened and claimed all XP chests during or post-Dishonour among Thieves.
val=75,Opened and claimed all loot chests during or post-Dishonour among Thieves.
val=76,Claimed 10,000 coins from Bill Teach post-Cabin Fever.
val=77,Claimed the Kipple Nano pet.
val=78,Claimed the medium XP lamp from Azzanadra post-Heart of Stone.
val=79,Unlocked the ability to chip teleport tablets to Trollheim.
val=80,Returned Mabel's Ring post-Love Story, and chopped down the Guard’s tree.
val=81,Claimed all rewards from the statue of Death post-Missing, Presumed Death.
val=82,Claimed the Helm of Zaros & Crest of Seren post-Fate of the Gods.
val=83,Claimed and used the post-Fate of the Gods XP lamps from Azzanadra and Wahisietel.
val=84,Unlocked Sliske's gift and the Sixth-age circuit upgrade.
val=85,Gained access to the secret treasure room post-Diamond in the Rough.
val=86,Gained access to the secret treasure room post-Do No Evil.
val=87,Claimed the elite clue scroll using Ava's Alerter post-Do No Evil.
val=88,Received the medium clue scroll from a monkey in your backpack.
val=89,Claimed the XP from the cave paintings and claimed 5,000 coins from Explorer Jack in the Land of Snow.
val=90,Spoken to Azacorax post-Rune Memories and gained Magic or Prayer XP.
val=91,Fully interacted and claimed all XP from the Mysterious Statues post-One of a Kind.
val=92,Claimed the extra Constitution XP post-Song from the Depths.
val=93,Claimed the Divination XP lamp post-Plague's End.
val=94,Claimed the Farming XP lamp post-Plague's End.
val=95,Claimed the Magic XP lamp post-Plague's End.
val=96,Claimed the Melee XP lamp post-Plague's End.
val=97,Claimed the Slayer XP lamp post-Plague's End.
val=98,Claimed the Smithing XP lamp post-Plague's End.
val=99,Unlocked the ability to grow three spirit trees at once.
val=100,Completed a job for Simon Templeton and unlocked the ability to trade noted artefacts.
val=101,Created the Big Bowl for Tears of Guthix.
val=102,Read and unlocked the Tune Banite Ore spell.
val=103,Claimed and read the Codex Ultimatus.
val=104,Claimed the gems from the demon throne during or post-The Golem.
val=105,Claimed Thieving XP post-Buyers and Cellars.
val=106,Claimed all XP lamps from Philipe Carnillean.
val=107,Claimed Smithing XP from Ramarno post-Defender of Varrock.
val=108,Bought an ancient staff post-Desert Treasure.
val=109,Claimed the reward lamp from natural historian post-Tales of the Muspah.
val=110,Claimed the coins from Yelps's cash bag during or post-The Mighty Fall.
val=111,Unlocked all hot-air balloon travel routes.
val=112,Handed in the demon statuettes post-The Blood Pact.
val=113,Completed all three additional challenges from Maria and unlocked all chests in the Broken Home quest.
val=114,Completed 5 supply runs post-Death Plateau.
val=115,Found all hidden treasure from Making History.
val=116,Fully enchanted your broomstick post-Swept Away.
val=117,Permanently cured Razmire Keelgan and Ulsquire Shauncy post-Shades of Mort'ton.
val=118,Unlocked the full power of the Ivandis Flail.
val=119,Hunted the Thalassus ten times post-Deadliest Catch.
val=120,Completed 25 chimp ice deliveries.
val=121,Unlocked the Ogre bowman hat.
val=122,Engraved all of Dororan's jewelery.
val=123,Defeated the Cave Wolf Matriarch again for Claus the chef post-Carnillean Rising.
val=124,Achieved the Master White Knight rank.
val=125,Put Arrav to rest post-Ritual of the Mahjarrat.
val=126,Unlocked all Rogue Trader merchandise.
val=127,Re-kindled the Dragon Forge.
val=128,Learned Tarn Razorlor's secrets.
val=129,Fully upgraded the Pig Creation machine.
