// 12413
[enum_12413]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,If you are going to pick a fight make sure it is one that you can win
val=2,Try to always be a fair enemy
val=3,Fortune tends to favour the bold, until they get squished by something bigger than them
val=4,Life is to you a dashing and bold adventure
val=5,Listen to your body, it is important to eat when you hunger
val=6,Do what you can to prolong your life, in the hope that someday you'll learn what it's for
val=7,Take a rest; you deserve it
val=8,Try everything once, if it doesn't harm you, consider a second time
val=9,Don't count your eggs before they are cooked, because chickens may require rearing
val=10,The road to riches is paved with burnt rocktails
val=11,Now is not your time for enlightenment, instead pursue simpler pleasures
val=12,It can be easier to negotiate with someone by first pleasing their stomach
val=13,Dispel negativity through artistic activities
val=14,Demonstrate refinement in everything you do
val=15,Creative activities can help bring you to a more positive state
val=16,Beauty will surround you - open your eyes to see it
val=17,When you feel defensive take stock of what you fear
val=18,If you can't beat them, get better armour
val=19,You will meet someone who is tall, dark, and handsome. Be wary of this person, they wish you harm
val=20,There may be trouble ahead, you should stay prepared
val=21,Spend time today with those that help you learn more about your hidden depths
val=22,Ask a friend to join you on your next journey, there is safety in numbers
val=23,Today is not looking good for you, you should stay inside
val=24,By helping someone else today you will be helping yourself
val=25,A single kind word can warm someone as much as a fire
val=26,The outlook for your day is looking much brighter than yesterday
val=27,When chaos burns like wildfire around us, sometimes we have no choice but to love the warmth
val=28,Only those that have experienced the cold can appreciate the light of warmth
val=29,Be still and be one with the water to find enlightenment
val=30,A ship in a port is safe, but that is not what they are built for
val=31,Return to simpler pursuits. If you can be placid while you work you will gain understanding
val=32,Sometimes you have to release what you catch, to understand what you had
val=33,Shoot for the moon! If you miss you will still be amongst the stars
val=34,Those who bring sunshine to the lives of others cannot keep it from themselves
val=35,Seeing what others do not can lead you to your own revelations
val=36,Those who dare to dream can access all of life's magic
val=37,Slow progress is better than no progress
val=38,Precious moments are like jewels, adding sparkle to our lives
val=39,The strongest character can be forged through effort and hard work
val=40,Sometimes you have to get dirty to reveal the treasures within
val=41,Trust your inner voice, for it knows more than you do
val=42,Your love light shines on another
val=43,Do not believe in miracles - rely on them
val=44,An idea is not responsible for the people who believe in it
val=45,Now is the time for caution, not fear. Do not let fear control you
val=46,If at first you don't succeed try again from further away
val=47,It is not the strong but the responsive that survive
val=48,Your skill today will be in changing direction with the swiftness of a bird
val=49,A calmness can be found in devoting yourself to gathering
val=50,Collecting moments is as important as collecting things
val=51,Surround yourself with mysterious locations and they will inspire you
val=52,Beautiful spaces create beautiful minds
val=53,Strength is built upon inner character
val=54,Conquer your fears, or they will conquer you
val=55,Grasp the opportunities that come your way
val=56,Don't confuse a single defeat with a final defeat
val=57,Hardship can be a blessing in disguise; storms make trees take deeper roots
val=58,It could be beneficial for you to go out on a limb today
val=59,Time spent in the company of trees is never time wasted
val=60,To gather the fruit sometimes you must first climb the tree
val=61,Lift yourself to greater heights to find what you are seeking
val=62,You need to keep everything in balance, you are prone to extremes
val=63,It is not advisable to leap before you look, but that may be all you have time for
val=64,Avert misunderstanding by calm, poise, and balance
val=65,It is important to surround yourself with home comforts today
val=66,Precision is imperative today, without it you will stumble
val=67,Good things take time. Take pleasure in the journey of creation
val=68,This life is yours. Some of it was given to you; the rest, you made yourself
val=69,Keep your memories close today, as they can bring you wisdom
val=70,Your energy returns and you will get things done
val=71,Remember yesterday, but live for today
val=72,When you feel lost look to your memories and they will guide you
val=73,The more seeds you sow, the more flowers will bloom
val=74,You are a person of culture, cultivate it
val=75,He who plants life will grown himself
val=76,Sometimes the greatest revelations come when you are at one with nature
val=77,Little and often makes much. Small things add up to greater than the sum of their parts
val=78,Carving is the process of turning your imagination into reality
val=79,It is important, for those who are inclined, to carve their own path through the world
val=80,Life is like crafting, there are no mistakes, only unique creations
val=81,Disease can be cured; fate is incurable
val=82,Take care of your body, it is the only place you have to live in
val=83,Let your food be your medicine, and your medicine be your food
val=84,The best medicine tastes bitter. Sometimes you have to provide your own sweetness
val=85,If you could read the minds of animals you would find only truth
val=86,Whilst you may feel this is the time for action, you should be patient, or you may become confused
val=87,It is not always about the skill of the pursuant, sometimes it is about the bait that they use
val=88,You can catch more creatures with papaya than with an onion
val=89,You will be an inspiration to others
val=90,The smart thing to do is to start trusting your intuition
val=91,Change your thoughts and you change your world
val=92,Be unconventional, even visionary
val=93,You have an ambitious nature and may make a name for yourself
val=94,Pursue your wishes aggressively
val=95,Know the opposition, its not always the enemy
val=96,Your talents will be recognized and suitably rewarded
val=97,Constant grinding can turn a shapeless form into beauty
val=98,Channel your strength and anger into creating something today, make something positive
val=99,Be your own salvation. Create yourself a protective shell
val=100,It is better to be brave and protected, than simply just brave
val=101,Engage in group activities that further your transformation
val=102,Be one with life and nature, feel your power flow through the lives of others
val=103,To get through the darkest times, you may have to summon others to help you
val=104,When your burden is too heavy, look for those who can help you carry it
val=105,Hold on to the things you want, possession is nine tenths of the law
val=106,What looks like a good deal may not be, be wary of who you buy from
val=107,You will find doors opening for you
val=108,All the best things come free of charge
val=109,Opportunity is knocking on your door, be sure to listen for it
val=110,If you don't try you will guarantee failure
val=111,Life is too complicated for anyone to truly understand it, so just have fun instead
val=112,Take your time today, haste will not help you
val=113,It is better to regret that which you have done, than the things you haven't tried
val=114,Relish the transitions in your life - they will happen anyway
val=115,Whilst you may feel this is the time for action, you should be patient, or you may become confused
val=116,It is more important to be happy than right
val=117,Fate doesn't always know what its doing, be prepared to stray from your chosen path
val=118,Live each day like it is your last, unless you are an ironman
val=119,A lifetime isn't nearly long enough to figure out what it's all about
val=120,Life is too short to hold grudges, unless they deserve it
default=null

