val=1,Click here or press Space to search for an item to buy.
val=2,Click the bar below or press Space to search for items.
val=7,Click edit or 'Add a new favourite' to search for an item to favourite.
val=3,Click on the left-hand side menu to exchange items for sets.<br><br>Click on the backpack to exchange sets for items.
val=4,You are not currently in a Clan Chat channel.<br><br>If you are not a member of a clan already, click the link below to visit the recruitment forums.<br><br>
val=5,You are not currently<br>a guest in a Clan Chat.<br>To join a Clan Chat as a<br>guest, click the join icon<br>and enter the name of<br>the clan you wish to chat with.
val=6,You don't meet all the requirements for this outfit. Please hover over the individual slots for details.
val=8,Click favourite to teleport
val=9,Right-click on rank text to change options.
val=10,(click to reuse this name)
val=11,The playlist is empty. You can add songs by returning to the music player and selecting 'Add to playlist' or by clicking one of the '+' icons.
val=12,Skills will automatically be tracked as you gain XP. Click on a row to pin it so it doesn't fall off.
val=13,Use the mouse wheel or the magnifier buttons to zoom in and out of the graph.
val=14,Click here to view your historical data in the RuneMetrics web app
val=15,To view your historical data visit the RuneMetrics web app by clicking on the image below.
val=16,Click on a line of text to choose the player you are reporting, then click the 'Next' button.<br>Silent offenders (bots/bug abuse) can be reported by right-clicking them and selecting the 'Examine' option, then clicking the report button in the top left.
val=100,You haven't got an Authenticator set up.<br><col=ffffff>Click here</col> to open the Support Centre and find out how to get one!
val=101,You do not have a registered email address! Having a registered and validated email address will make account recovery quicker and easier. <col=ffffff>Click here</col> to change your email settings!
val=102,You haven't got a bank PIN. You should really consider getting one.<br><col=ffffff>Click here</col> to open the Support Centre and find out how to get one!
val=103,Your email address is not validated! Having a validated address will make account recovery quicker and easier. <col=ffffff>Click here</col> to change your email settings!
val=104,<col=ffffff>Click here</col> to find out about how you could make your account even more secure!
val=17,Click on the flashing Build icon when you're ready to continue.
val=18,Upgrade the office by clicking on the Build Mode button.
val=19,Hover over the wing and defender symbols to gain more information. When you want to assign or unassign a defending team, drag their icon to or from a wing symbol.
default=

