// 14954
[enum_14954]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> Dear Gail.
val=1,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> For reasons I've never understood, you've always been there for us. And we both know that you've seen me at the berry bush. For these reasons, I owe you the truth.
val=2,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> When I found out what mum was doing, turning back time to keep me alive, I struggled with what to do. I thought about confronting her, and telling her to stop.
val=3,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> To let me die. To enjoy the moments left with me.
val=4,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> But I knew that wouldn't stop her. She would find a moment when I was asleep to go back in time, to begin another loop without me being aware.
val=5,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> There was only one thing I could do. A necessary evil. I couldn't let mum know that I was aware of the Returnings, so I determined to follow her through every time loop.
val=6,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> I hope you understand why I am doing this. Please, don't reveal me or my plan. Let me keep coming to the berry bush.
val=7,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> If not for me, do this for mum. I do all of this for her. She needs to break this loop so that she can live herself.
val=8,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> Look after her, Gail.
val=9,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> Primrose.
default=null

// 14955
[enum_14955]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<p=0>Dear Gail.
val=1,<p=0>For reasons I've never understood, you've always been there for us. And we both know that you've seen me at the berry bush. For these reasons, I owe you the truth.
val=2,<p=0>When I found out what mum was doing, turning back time to keep me alive, I struggled with what to do. I thought about confronting her, and telling her to stop.
val=3,<p=0>To let me die. To enjoy the moments left with me.
val=4,<p=0>But I knew that wouldn't stop her. She would find a moment when I was asleep to go back in time, to begin another loop without me being aware.
val=5,<p=0>There was only one thing I could do. A necessary evil. I couldn't let mum know that I was aware of the Returnings, so I determined to follow her through every time loop.
val=6,<p=0>I hope you understand why I am doing this. Please, don't reveal me or my plan. Let me keep coming to the berry bush.
val=7,<p=0>If not for me, do this for mum. I do all of this for her. She needs to break this loop so that she can live herself.
val=8,<p=0>Look after her, Gail.
val=9,<p=0>Primrose.
default=null

// 14956
[enum_14956]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> Megan asked that I stay by the Needle. She was to look after Primrose from now on. Somewhere along the line, she had lost her trust in me.
val=1,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> Before a Returning, she would often burn Primrose's books.
val=2,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> It was like a ritual. A habit that she couldn't crawl out of. But Primrose wouldn't wake from it this time. She lay in bed and ignored it.
val=3,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> If Megan was clearer of mind, she would have seen it for the clue that it was: Primrose was aware of everything she was doing.
default=null

// 14957
[enum_14957]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<p=0>Megan asked that I stay by the Needle. She was to look after Primrose from now on. Somewhere along the line, she had lost her trust in me.
val=1,<p=0>Before a Returning, she would often burn Primrose's books.
val=2,<p=0>It was like a ritual. A habit that she couldn't crawl out of. But Primrose wouldn't wake from it this time. She lay in bed and ignored it.
val=3,<p=0>If Megan was clearer of mind, she would have seen it for the clue that it was: Primrose was aware of everything she was doing.
default=null

// 14958
[enum_14958]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> Joss, Primrose and Megan weren't the first people I had encountered.
val=1,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> There were the people of the Colony to the east. But they were a fearful people, and hid behind their walls.
val=2,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> There were the smaller people of the south-east. They were quick to their pikes, and pushed me back into the treeline.
val=3,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> Men and women would occasionally stray close to me, but they were so caught up in their hunting and woodcutting that I didn't want to interrupt.
val=4,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> But there was something different about the family. They seemed to have this happy energy, and I wondered what it would be like to share in that.
default=null

// 14959
[enum_14959]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<p=2>Joss, Primrose and Megan weren't the first people I had encountered.
val=1,<p=2>There were the people of the Colony to the east. But they were a fearful people, and hid behind their walls.
val=2,<p=2>There were the smaller people of the south-east. They were quick to their pikes, and pushed me back into the treeline.
val=3,<p=2>Men and women would occasionally stray close to me, but they were so caught up in their hunting and woodcutting that I didn't want to interrupt.
val=4,<p=2>But there was something different about the family. They seemed to have this happy energy, and I wondered what it would be like to share in that.
default=null

// 14960
[enum_14960]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> Is there death in my future? Can I die? 
val=1,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> Or am I more kin to the Needle than Primrose or Megan?
val=2,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> Whatever the answer, I feel like I have more stories in me. I don't feel like this is the end.
val=3,<col=ff0000>Gail:</col> Something tells me that this is not the beginning either.
default=null

// 14961
[enum_14961]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<p=2>Is there death in my future? Can I die? 
val=1,<p=2>Or am I more kin to the Needle than Primrose or Megan?
val=2,<p=2>Whatever the answer, I feel like I have more stories in me. I don't feel like this is the end.
val=3,<p=2>Something tells me that this is not the beginning either.
default=null

